  and  final shave margin  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm in aggregate of yellow breast tissue which is entirely submitted as F H  R T  V  W and AA CC  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right axillary contents  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 5cm portion of yellow adipose tissue which contains multiple tan red rubbery to tan white firm lymph nodes ranging in size from 0 3cm to 2 5cm in greatest dimension  I  3 whole lymph nodes J  3 whole lymph nodes K  1 bisected lymph node L  1 bisected lymph node M  1 bisected lymph node Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  additional medial margin right breast  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm portion of yellow adipose tissue  The specimen is entirely submitted as N Q  Gross Description by  LORI MARINI Resident  WEN JING  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  W B Jerry Younger  M D  PART A  BREAST  RIGHT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART B  LYMPH NODE  RIGHT AXILLARY SENTINEL   EXCISION PART C  BREAST  FINAL SHAVED MARGIN   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART D  LYMPH NODE  RIGHT AXILLARY CONTENTS  PART E  BREAST  ADDITIONAL MEDIAL MARGIN   EXCISIONAL BIOP , Unchecked.
