gins  2 0cm from the lateral or medial margin and 8 0cm from the medial or lateral margin  and 1 2cm from the anterior margin  Section Code  A  tumor mass and biopsy cavity   deep margin   B  tumor and deep margin  A and B are the entire tumor   C  biopsy cavity and skin   anterior margin   D  biopsy cavity and anterior margin  E F  biopsy site and tumor  G  biospy site and tumor  Labeled  Axillary contents  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 4 0cm aggregate of fibrofatty tissue sectioned to reveal multiple pink to tan lymph nodes  The largest is primarily fatty replaced that measures approximately 4 5cm in greatest dimension  The lymph node dissection in cassettes H through M  Resident  MARISA BALDASSANO  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Susan E Briggs  M D  PART A  BREAST  RIGHT   RE EXCISION PART B  LYMPH NODES  RIGHT AXILLA   EXCISION , Unchecked.
