tts General Hospital  They have not been cleared or approved by the U S  Food and Drug Administration  FDA   The FDA has determined that such clearance or approval is not necessary  this laboratory has established and verified the test s accuracy and precision  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  17 REMOVED_MONTH 99 at 08 51 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right axillary sentinel lymph node  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1cm tan yellow fibrofatty tissue fragment  bivalved and entirely frozen as FX  1  resubmitted in cassette A  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right breast mass  is a 7 x 5 x 4 5cm firm breast tissue with a long stitch designating the lateral margin and a short stitch designating the superior margin  The specimen is inked as follows  anterior margin  black  posterior margin  blue  superior margin  red  inferior margin  orange  lateral margin  yellow  and medial margin  green  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal a relatively well circumscribed gray tan tumor measuring REMOVED_DATE x 2 x 2cm  0 2cm from the lateral margin  0 6cm from the inferior margin and at least REMOVED_DATE from the other margins  The rest of the breast parenchyma appears grossly unremarkable  Representative sections are submitted as follows  tumor with the nearest inferior margin in B  representative section from tumor cassettes C through F  representative section from other parts of the parenchyma in cassettes G through J  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right axillary non sentinel node  is a 1 x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm lymph node  entirely submitted in cassette K  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right additional breast tissue  are two fragments of fibroadipose tissue measuring 5 x 3 x 1cm and 4 x