ever  those are non contributory as no tumor cells are represented on the sections provided for immunohistochemical stains  No additional information on the hormone receptor or Her 2 profile of those isolated tumor cells can be provided  Dr Smith was notified about the additional findings by email on REMOVED_DATE  Addendum  3 by Elena F Brachtel M D   Electronically signed on Friday REMOVED_MONTH 02   REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 05 41 42PM By his her signature above  the pathologist listed as making the Final Diagnosis certifies that he she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed or corrected the diagnoses  PART A  Breast  Left   Modified Radical Mastectomy PART B  Breast  Left Additional Axillary Tissue   Excision  report_end  , Unchecked.
