ary contents   is a REMOVED_DATE x 6 x 3cm fibrofatty tissue specimen  lymph nodes dissected out and submitted in O R  Resident  Frank P  Fechner  M D      INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     GROSS DIAGNOSIS  BREAST  RIGHT   INFILTRATING CARCINOMA  CLOSE TO POSTERIOR MARGIN  ALL OTHER MARGINS FREE  O R  Resident  DARRYL E  PALMER TOY  MD PhD O R  Diagnosis by  Nancy Lee Harris  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART A  BREAST  RIGHT   EXCISION PART B  LYMPH NODES  RIGHT AXILLA   EXCISION PART C  BREAST  RIGHT  MEDIAL CAVITY    RE EXCISION PART D  BREAST  RIGHT  FINAL SHAVED MARGIN    RE EXCISION   report_end  , Unchecked.
